OL,3,GNEWSAEx-House of Fraser store to regain
OL,4,A1913 shopfront
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than #2.6m has been awarded to
OL,7,Ftransform Grimsby's former House of
OL,8,FFraser building to how it looked more
OL,9,Fthan 100 years ago.
OL,11,FThe modern shopfront on Victoria Street
OL,12,Fwill undergo specialist workmanship to
OL,13,Fcreate a design inspired by the
OL,14,FEdwardian elegance of the Guy & Smith
OL,15,Fdepartment store as it appeared in
OL,16,F1913.
OL,18,FThe money from the National Lottery
OL,19,FHeritage Fund will also go towards
OL,20,Fheritage events in the town, including
OL,21,Fpermanent displays, workshops and an
OL,22,Fexhibition in late 2027.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
